<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage above 10 bln rand Fri.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage above 10 bln rand Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 10.291 billion rand on Friday from 9.762 billion rand on Thursday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
